  ("In the motivation letter you have to explain why you chose this particular program.", "Sa motivation letter, kailangan mong ipaliwanag kung bakit ang mismong programang ito ang pinili mo."),
  ("I asked two professors to write me a letter of recommendation.", "Hiniling ko sa dalawang propesor na sulatan ako ng recommendation letter."),
  ("The master's study plan also includes an internship abroad.", "Kasama rin sa study plan ng master's ang isang internship sa ibang bansa."),
