  ("The session moderator stopped the speaker because his time was up.", "Pinahinto ng moderator ng sesyon ang tagapagsalita dahil ubos na ang oras niya."),
  ("The opening keynote was the most interesting part of the conference.", "Ang pambungad na keynote ang pinakakawili-wiling bahagi ng kumperensya."),
