  ("If you can't come in person, you can send someone else with a power of attorney. (polite)", "Kung hindi po kayo makakapunta nang personal, puwede po kayong magpadala ng ibang tao na may power of attorney."),
  ("Now the state fee can also be paid online.", "Ngayon, puwede na ring bayaran online ang bayarin sa gobyerno."),
